        {
          "exampleId": "w:response#e-294a82d4097c0ade",
          "text": "A couple of years ago film-maker David Bond realised that his children, then aged five and three, were attached to screens to the point where he was able to say “chocolate” into his three-year-old son’s ear without getting a response.",
